To handle various transaction formats robustly and ensure type safety when summing, we should ensure that any extracted debit or credit amounts are converted to a numeric type (like `float` or `Decimal`, or falling back/coercing appropriately) or handling cases where items in `debits` and `credits` might be objects/dicts with an amount attribute/key.

